WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.402
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:01.402 --> 00:00:06.043
Open the demo: the tab bar keeps Library, Search, Add, Tags and You in reach.

3
00:00:06.043 --> 00:00:11.050
Paste a link: the preview fills in by itself.

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.220
Pick a folder, add a tag and a note.

5
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.379
Save, and the card lands in your feed.

6
00:00:18.379 --> 00:00:27.001
Saved it before? Shelfmark tells you where.

7
00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:33.434
Folders nest inside folders; a new one starts empty.

8
00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:41.699
Hold a folder for its menu: a color, and an emoji found by search.

9
00:00:41.699 --> 00:00:44.448
Pin the folders you use most.

10
00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:48.501
Hold and drag to reorder: a line shows where it lands.

11
00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:51.075
Unpin with one tap, Undo if you change your mind.

12
00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:53.803
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

13
00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:59.002
Star the keepers; Favorites gathers them.

14
00:00:59.002 --> 00:01:04.737
Move to folder opens a sheet: search it, the current folder is marked.

15
00:01:04.737 --> 00:01:06.708
The toast has Undo, in case it was the wrong folder.

16
00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:13.586
Hold a card to select, tap to add more…

17
00:01:13.586 --> 00:01:22.000
…favorite, copy, share or move them together.

18
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.713
Need it again? Tap Search and type.

19
00:01:25.713 --> 00:01:30.096
Saved views sit above the feed: All, Videos, Articles…

20
00:01:30.096 --> 00:01:37.587
Options: sort it your way, switch between cards and a list.

21
00:01:37.587 --> 00:01:42.001
Recently opened: filter, search, or pause the history.

22
00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:47.764
Deleted by mistake? Undo brings it right back.

23
00:01:47.764 --> 00:01:56.002
Trash keeps what you delete; restore it any time.

24
00:01:56.002 --> 00:01:59.644
Light, dark, or Custom with your own accent color…

25
00:01:59.644 --> 00:02:04.427
…and Shelfmark keeps it readable: 4.5:1 contrast, always.

26
00:02:04.427 --> 00:02:08.156
In six languages.

27
00:02:08.156 --> 00:02:15.001
And tell us what you think: we read every message.

28
00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.758
With an account, share a folder as a public page.

29
00:02:17.758 --> 00:02:21.111
Make it public and copy its link.

30
00:02:21.111 --> 00:02:27.909
Now and then Shelfmark asks how you like it: one tap.

31
00:02:27.909 --> 00:02:32.388
Your account: the photo you sign in with, your shelf in numbers…

32
00:02:32.388 --> 00:02:35.211
…and Your data: export everything as JSON or a bookmarks file.

33
00:02:35.211 --> 00:02:37.013
Install Shelfmark from the browser menu and it joins your Share menu.

34
00:02:37.013 --> 00:02:39.972
Share a page from any app, and it lands on your shelf.

35
00:02:39.972 --> 00:02:42.644
Anyone with the link sees a read-only page, no account needed.

36
00:02:42.644 --> 00:02:44.645
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
